Maintainer: Konrad Stawiski <konrad.stawiski@umed.lodz.pl>
Description: A toolkit for biomarker discovery from high-dimensional omics
    data. Enforces nested cross-validation with leakage-resistant feature
    selection, computes feature stability metrics, and provides multi-objective
    signature selection. Built on the mlr3 ecosystem for reproducible machine
    learning pipelines. Supports multi-omics integration, frozen batch-effect
    correction, model calibration, provenance-aware validation gates,
    within-sample biomarker panel methods, and SHAP-based interpretability.
